# 4-Player Team Schnapsen Rules

This project implements a specific 4-player team variant of Schnapsen with unique mechanics.

## Card Deck

- 24 cards total: 4 suits × 6 ranks
- Hungarian suits: PIROS, ZOLD, TOK, MAKK
- Ranks (with point values): IX (0), ALSO (2), FELSO (3), KIRALY (4), X (10), ASZ (11)

## Game Structure

**One Game consists of:**
- 6 rounds (each player plays all 6 cards)
- 4 players, each receives 6 cards at start
- Starting player chosen at game start

**Round (one round = all 4 players play one card):**
- Starting player leads with a card
- Other 3 players follow (counterclockwise)
- Round winner determined by trump/suit/rank
- Round winner becomes starting player of next round

## Team Mechanics (Unique Feature)

**Team Formation:**
- Starting player declares trump card (not just suit - specific card)
- Trump card's suit becomes trump suit
- Teams: (Starting player + Trump card holder) vs (Other two players)
- Special case: If starting player holds trump card → 3v1 situation

**Team Discovery:**
- Players on non-trump team don't initially know their teammate
- Team membership becomes certain as cards are revealed/played
- Tracker should detect and announce when team membership is confirmed

## Trump Declaration

- Starting player draws first 3 cards
- Declares a specific trump card (not in their hand)
- This card's suit becomes trump
- Then starting player sees remaining 3 cards
- First round begins

## Scoring

- Points collected per round based on card values
- Game ends after all 6 rounds complete
- Winner determined by total points

## Tracker Purpose

The tracker assists during physical games by:
- Recording all card actions (draws, plays, trump declaration)
- Tracking possible cards in each opponent's hand (elimination-based)
- Detecting team membership certainty
- Maintaining scores
- Tracking one complete game, then exits
